:"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119588","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-06-28T14:24:10Z"},{"id":4599494715,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEia4Ow","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","commit_id":"4cd2cb22177679d459e50156adf9afeb7031e2ca","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?u=b7882c94f408976a2f79e8fe6e1ce27fbd48db74&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","login":"HolonProduction","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction"},"body":"The GDScript and core changes look good to me.\n\nThere is a slight off-by-one issue though. For errors the ranges seem to be one char longer than they should be (not noticeable in your screenshot since the error ends at the last char on the line):\n\n<img width=\"204\" height=\"138\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3818be66-dcb2-4910-bc40-a4a402846b0f\" />\n\nAs compared to VSCode\n\n<img width=\"210\" height=\"99\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d5c1879e-3b8f-4410-8d15-ca97d1a74850\" />\n\nYou are probably missing an adjustment somewhere because the `ScriptLanguage` column numbers are one-based.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119588#pullrequestreview-4599494715","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119588","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-06-30T10:27:23Z"},{"id":4607823418,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEqXOOg","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"5b052e9393439e6eca90f0f91e86e42d60968330","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?u=b7882c94f408976a2f79e8fe6e1ce27fbd48db74&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","login":"HolonProduction","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction"},"body":"Works well in my testing.\n\nHaven't looked at the editor and gui code. The GDScript stuff LGTM the core stuff too. \n\nI don't think a dedicated core review is necessary, since all changes are related to the editor specific parts of `ScriptLanguage` but if someone from core wants to double check, be my guest.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119588#pullrequestreview-4607823418","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119588","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-07-01T10:00:30Z"},{"id":4618459305,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABE0gYqQ","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"5b052e9393439e6eca90f0f91e86e42d60968330","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected. Code and design look good to me.\r\n\r\n### 100% editor scale\r\n\r\nDefault | Light\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"255\" height=\"229\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6828d9cd-bf75-40a5-a691-a85cb30c30bc\" /> | <img width=\"255\" height=\"229\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/422945ba-cea1-4e2e-b075-627d9a439349\" />\r\n\r\n### 150% editor scale\r\n\r\nDefault | Light\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"285\" height=\"221\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cfa761ad-d9b0-4407-a80c-cefbebec3777\" /> | <img width=\"285\" height=\"221\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e7c7a4dc-1665-4bc8-b4a5-2b66e2a187d3\" />\r\n\r\n### 200% editor scale\r\n\r\nDefault | Light\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"268\" height=\"204\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/949c6f57-dd9e-4212-beff-9f03fb329576\" /> | <img width=\"268\" height=\"204\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a4a610ac-748d-40f6-ac6d-adf5ed655f82\" />\r\n\r\n**Edit:** Seeing the above screenshots scaled down to 100% makes me realize that line spacing currently depends on editor scale somewhat. This should be fixed in a separate PR.\r\n\r\nUnderlines appear thicker at higher editor scales (relative to the current editor scale), but I know why this is happening. Fixing this can be done in a separate PR as there are many other locations in other Control nodes where it occurs, but it's fairly involved:\r\n\r\n- The editor uses the `disabled` stretch mode, and increases the font size according to the editor scale. At higher font sizes, the underline thickness automatically increases.\r\n\r\n- Intuitively, I'd say projects with the `canvas_items` stretch mode don't automatically increase their font size. Instead, oversampling does the job. Therefore, underline thickness doesn't automatically increase. In fact, `theme_cache.base_scale` is not automatically increased either; it's a project setting that can be set only at startup, not at runtime. Therefore, no scaling actually occurs if you use the `canvas_items` stretch mode and just rely on Godot's automatic scaling.\r\n\r\n  - However, testing with LinkButton (which relies on font underline thickness) in a project contradicts this. The underline does scale there.\r\n\r\nSince this isn't exposed to scripting, I think you could remove the `* theme_cache.base_scale` multiplier (with a comment to explain why).\r\n\r\nHere's 200% editor scale with `* theme_cache.base_scale` removed (displayed at 100% scale unless you click on it):\r\n\r\n100% editor scale | 200% editor scale (with multiplier removed)\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"255\" height=\"229\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6828d9cd-bf75-40a5-a691-a85cb30c30bc\" /> | <img width=\"213\" height=\"185\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9a9b31dc-f92c-4068-9631-cee9ab47d2c8\" />","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119588#pullrequestreview-4618459305","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119588","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-07-02T14:29:32Z"},{"id":4767232593,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHCYyUQ","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"6dcb705abad0298d55607ca1bf5619384bbd005b","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?u=8069d9b7bc6ab503ce83dfcfa53fd021672aeccf&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","login":"Mickeon","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon"},"body":"Usability-wise, this is beyond welcome.\nThe code is quite daunting, but I would expect nothing less due to how much is required to properly draw the squiggles (part of the reason why it wasn't present before this PR). I did still carefully look at the code.\n\nI do appreciate the additional comments in `text_edit.cpp` for the line squiggles. One would usually say that the code has to explain itself, but this time it'd be difficult for it to. Still, some of them may be a bit excessive, or worth shuffling around to flow better.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119588#pullrequestreview-4767232593","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119588","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-07-23T20:02:37Z"},{"id":4768194767,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHDTgzw","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"6dcb705abad0298d55607ca1bf5619384bbd005b","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?u=64fc5e539030609be0447a74243d9fc643fa9bf3&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","login":"Meorge","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119588#pullrequestreview-4768194767","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119588","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-07-23T21:05:24Z"},{"id":4768213154,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHDUoog","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"6dcb705abad0298d55607ca1bf5619384bbd005b","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?u=8069d9b7bc6ab503ce83dfcfa53fd021672aeccf&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","login":"Mickeon","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119588#pullrequestreview-4768213154","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119588","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-07-23T21:08:31Z"},{"